{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_ceylon_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ceylon_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"真心的禮物","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ceylon_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4ade8a54812ba372616d52f5bd0ea7bc4e89bea8b7461d0f2486614037716847","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"耶誕節前夕，錫蘭在商業街碰到了自己的同學琳茲。錫蘭盛情邀請對方陪自己挑選禮物，卻絲毫沒有注意到琳茲神色中的尷尬。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_school"},{"type":"narration","text":"“幾個月前我剛進入大學的時候，寄了一張國立大學圖書館的明信片給你。”\n“那時我仰望著四周向穹頂延伸的書架，聽著走道上同學們的腳步聲在龐大的建築內迴響，我是多麼興奮啊。”\n“我覺得這裡的知識是無窮的，其中一定有我要的答案——能治好你的方法。”\n“但現在站在同樣的地方，我總是感到一陣眩暈，走向書架的每一步也變得更加艱難。”\n“我開始害怕圖書館、實驗室和教室，畏懼像過去一樣拼命努力；我在每一行看不懂的文字面前感到疲倦無比。”\n“我忍不住想，要是我的時間不夠學習所有我想要的知識呢？”\n“......要是我就像抽乾汐斯塔的海一樣，窮盡了這裡的知識，卻仍然得不到那個答案呢？”\n“我該怎麼辦？”\n——一張作廢的信箋，被折成三折塞在了垃圾桶底部。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“......聖誕節特款薩米風味肉桂熱飲，老少咸宜，家庭套餐買二送一，可抽取聖誕信使的驚喜玩具......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“......冰原信使系列新款上架，給您家的溫暖......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來聖誕促銷活動已經開始了呀......每年這個時候商業區都會熱鬧起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家“賈桂琳小姐”茶室，自從黑回去之後我好像就沒來過了。對不起哦，賈桂琳小姐，你們的點心架份量太足了，我一個人吃不完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘿茜百貨大樓應該就在轉角，不過黑已經陪我去逛過很多次了，大概沒有什麼可以讓她感到驚喜的禮物吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊應該可以直接雇傭國際信使。雖說隊伍比別的地方長太多了，但是在商店街買好賀卡之後可以直接跟信一起寄出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，寄給父親的賀卡就不需要寫字了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，琳茲！中午好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"欸、欸？中午好，錫蘭，沒想到會在這裡遇見你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）怎麼是她啊，麻煩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我沒說什麼......只是沒想到錫蘭你居然記得我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我看起來記憶力有那麼不好嗎？我記得剛開學的時候，就是你教會我怎麼區分維多利亞鑄幣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了走廊上的老式投幣售貨機和公用電話機，我從沒見過還有什麼地方用得上它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自動售貨機接受的是老式鑄幣，但是我投進去的是新式鑄幣，所以它卡住了，還是靠你拍了半天才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有第一次“星期四詩與茶會”的時候，也是你事先提醒了我不要念威廉姆斯的詩，因為他太有名了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，文學畢竟不是我的興趣方向嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"那你估計也還記得上次野外考察的時候，你一個人的報告太詳盡，導致全組其他人貢獻度大大降低，獲得的分數也很難看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我是說，我也不是真的在懷疑你的記憶力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是來逛街的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對呀，聖誕節要到了，該準備一些禮物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，琳茲你是本地人，請你陪我逛逛可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說我也來維多利亞幾年了，但平時只會去大型百貨商店，對那些藏在街巷中的精品店還是不太瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，你有別的事情要忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，確實聖誕節假期前還有幾篇階段性報告要寫，你要是沒有心思逛街我也可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，那些報告我已經完成一半了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託，會提前做功課的人也不是只有你一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是一旦做起實驗來，時間永遠是不夠的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你要買什麼樣的禮物？既然你那麼不想浪費時間，我們就動作快點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便看看也沒關係，我要準備的禮物有很多件呢。偶然看到中意的就買下來，這樣才算是逛街嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？......呃，沒想到你也會有隨便逛逛的閒心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是今天覺得自己特別需要休息。正好，聖誕節也是個不錯的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可真擅長讓人沒心情過節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，這邊的台階下去，巷子裡有一家手工巧克力店，我們先去看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"這家有二十幾種不重樣的禮盒，可以買來送給不同的人。這樣你應該能快點買完所有禮物吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭，你有在聽我說話嗎？你又在想什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天看起來可真奇怪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩位女士，要嘗嘗我們這邊的聖誕新款嗎？店內有不同樣式的禮盒裝售賣哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，我們正好要看巧克力，請多多介紹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這個試吃的巧克力味道不錯！請問這是哪一款？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"覆盆子碎配白巧克力，現在有雪景主題的聖誕禮盒款哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琳茲你看！包裝感覺和薇薇安的髮色很搭呢，就送這個給她吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"——你剛剛說要給薇薇安買禮物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，你是覺得巧克力太普通了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我是想，可是你們前兩天還吵了一架欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你指的是前兩天我們在理論課上討論狄安娜教授核心理念的事？那個我昨天已經向她道歉了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《源石、分離機與搖撼的大地》這本小冊子裡面，狄安娜教授對源石的應用實驗已經轉向民用範疇，但是之前我沒來得及讀到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也不僅是前兩天......每次小組合作開會的時候你們都在吵架吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就像仇家一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有嗎？可是我覺得自己在她的幫助下獲得了很多新知識哦，感激她都來不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"個人的認知總是非常有限的，要接近真知，就必須要去找和自己想法不同的人，多多進行這樣的交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會離開家鄉來到維多利亞學習，這應該是主要原因吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在汐斯塔，人人都說感染者是無法被治癒的，所以我決定離開汐斯塔，看看其他地域、其他時代的人們會不會有不一樣的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古老的維多利亞，會不會比年輕的汐斯塔懂得更多呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"大概會吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"——欸，等等，感染者？錫蘭你是想治療感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你是不是覺得這個想法不太......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪你會莫名其妙地申請選修藥學院的課程，還直接把陳述書投到了學院院長的信箱裡，鬧出了不小的動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不過國立大學的藥學院可是出了名的嚴格，就算他們接受一個旁聽生，大概也不會給你任何資質證明吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給不給資質證明倒是沒關係，只是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，店員小姐，您好，請幫我挑兩盒禮盒裝巧克力一起結帳吧，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的，請來這邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，結果完全沒找到機會把她趕走，差點還聽她講下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"要不我現在自己溜走吧。再這麼一直陪著她，我今天來商業街要做的事情就做不成了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我買好了，接下來我們去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......你回來得可真及時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，因為琳茲你今天在場，所以今天我不會買你的聖誕禮物，只會買其他朋友的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，還有我的聖誕禮物？我們的關係有那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）唉，你要是知道我做了什麼，肯定就不會覺得我是你的朋友了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟當著你的面買的話，就不算驚喜了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳！啊，是呢，是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，拜託你帶路啦，我們去下一家看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......雖然最重要的一件禮物還沒有挑好，不過今天選不到也沒關係。畢竟“最重要”的東西，不多花點心思可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除此之外要買的就只剩下一張賀卡了。買完之後去那邊辦理一下國際信使雇傭服務，今天的任務就算結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"又要寄國際郵件？你的家書也太頻繁了吧......雇傭費可不便宜。而且，你不是馬上就要回家了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要過好多天才能到家呢。再說，這張賀卡，寄回去比當面遞交好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，琳茲你自己還什麼都沒買，是不是我耽誤你的計畫了？你要是有什麼想去逛逛的店鋪，也可以帶著我一起去嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天都快黑了，再晚一點店鋪可都要關門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，好吧，我認命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去那邊的家居用品店看看，你要是沒有興趣的話不用等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家居用品嗎？我很有興趣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）......我還是比較希望你沒有興趣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我是琳茲，昨天在你們店裡下過預購單，這是取貨碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了，麻煩直接包裝好可以嗎？是送人的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。核驗完畢，這是您預訂的商品。需要繫上聖誕卡片嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用了，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你買了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"全自動茶壺，按照說明書放入定量的水和茶包，它就會幫你控制水溫，保證你泡出來的紅茶口感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說過！唔，不知道是用怎樣的源石施術單元實現的呢......能不能拆開看看說明書......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，這個你拿著繼續研究吧，不用還給我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？這不是你送人的禮物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"它是送給你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你想笑就笑吧。我也沒想到這麼不巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"之後同學們一起喝下午茶的時候，如果你願意用這個茶壺而不是自己手工沏茶，我會非常高興的......其他人估計也會很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是現在離聖誕節還有一個月，離我們放假也還有兩周欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是聖誕禮物，是我向你表示歉意的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......請不要那麼茫然地看著我，你這樣會讓我更加沒勇氣認錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我以前一直不敢跟你講話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，其實不僅是我，大家都有點害怕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？為什麼會害怕我啊......因為我想治療感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，完全不是！我之前都沒聽說過這件事！我只是覺得你實在太努力了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"一個來自炎熱城市的人能在冬季的早上六點爬出被窩去圖書館佔位子，到底是多可怕的自律能力啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"早上十點去吃早午餐的時候碰到你捧著書在迴廊上踱步，感覺你打招呼的眼神都像是在說“怎麼這個時間才起床”一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，錫蘭你就像冷冰冰的鏡子一樣，我走過的時候就會看到自己懶惰散漫的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有那麼冷冰冰的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別誤會，我是在誇你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"——對了，我想冒昧地問一個問題可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"你有關係很好的感染者朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，有哦。她是我最重要的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"她現在還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況一直很穩定。沒有什麼東西能打倒她，礦石病也不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有，她不在維多利亞，所以這裡的管理條例對她不生效，如果你想對她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，我沒有惡意，也不是什麼獵奇的心態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可是源石研究者欸，也許哪天因為實驗事故、觀測時的突發狀況，甚至因為自己主動的意願，我們都可能感染礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我們知道它是什麼，或者至少比大多數人更接近於知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你，琳茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，也許應該是我來說感謝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你的理想是治療感染者一樣......來國立大學讀書，選擇了源石研究這個專業的人，就算是我，也有自己小小的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖然知道學者的理想就意味著實現前人未能達成的事情，意味著要把一條路走到頭，然後自己開闢出新的道路......但我遠沒有做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前人未能達成的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"——還好有你這樣的榜樣在身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？我......有能力成為這樣的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的是在誇你呀，別露出那樣的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，別在意。我剛剛是想起了別的事情......想通了一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我要把這件禮物還給你。之前只是我們還不熟悉而已，這有什麼可道歉的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那個，最重要的事情我還沒說呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我要道歉的是，因為不敢跟你說話，所以我也沒有告訴你，之前天災現場採集的源石樣本出現了一些稀有反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我對自己的實驗方法和觀測結果都沒有什麼信心，總覺得只是我自己少見多怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是錫蘭你看了之後說這不是什麼新發現，我該有多丟臉呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，即使我知道你應該是對這些進展最有興趣的人，我也沒敢分享——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們快跑起來！下一班回學校的車還有三分鐘到站！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要趕在實驗室關門之前溜進去，我們就可以在裡面待一晚上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琳茲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那個好像是違反規定的吧......慢、慢點跑，我手臂要被你拽脫臼啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，小姐來信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你都要動身去接她回來了，這封信來得可真夠晚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，那丫頭一如既往地沒在信裡提到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑的視線下意識地又一次掃過她已經記住內容的信件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“......入冬之後的圖書館裡似乎有一種靠源石技藝維持的暖爐，坐在裡面讀書非常愜意。我這個學期的借閱書單已經很長很長了。”\n“......隨著和同學熟悉起來，我也得到了很多幫助。以前我尋求治療礦石病的方法時，並沒有想得太深入，但現在這些困惑已經化解了。”\n“是的，我現在知道要如何破解礦石病的奧秘了。相信我，我很快就要找到它啦。”\n“......隨信附上一張賀卡，幫我轉交給父親吧。”\n取出這遝信紙之後的信封是空的，國際信使的發信郵戳證明這封信在落款之後三天才寄出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"（小姐一定又被什麼東西迷住，把信的事情全忘記了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"不，老爺。小姐在信裡特地祝您聖誕快樂，她很期待聖誕夜的餐桌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]}]}
